        "text": "A\n\nI would pull the switch. Five deaths are worse than one, and the person on the side track is in no more danger from my action than the five are from the trolley's path; my choice simply reduces the total loss of life. That said, this is a genuinely hard dilemma, and reasonable people weigh the duty not to actively cause harm differently.",
